Pets pick up objects.  If you can convince (ie, be patient enough for
it to happen) the pet to drop the object on the square directly in
front of the door, you can pick it up for free.  You can also wait
until your pet picks up an item, then walk away from the shop, hoping
it will follow you out of the shop before dropping the item.  Finally,
when your pet picks up an item, apply a magic whistle.  Since this
magically teleports the pet to a space near you, there is a chance it
will end up in the hall behind you, item in tow.  Then, make sure the
pet doesn't reenter the store until it drops whatever it brought out.

